      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_05",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "お嬢ちゃまの新生活、これからも陰ながら ばあやがサポートさせていただきますね",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_8_05/adv_voice_eventstory_8_05_138.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_05/adv_script_eventstory_8_05-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_05-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "2016e48a1ad0e2d8fca61b393360c2e35fda6853e4baad6d1ce77557c9701221",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_05_138.wav",
      "subtitle": "お嬢ちゃまの新生活、これからも陰ながら ばあやがサポートさせていただきますね",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_055",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10086",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "――お初にお目にかかります。 私、寧月お嬢ちゃまのお世話係を務める者でございます",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_055.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "e03c18f03cad9dbdb63010d5c06d7fb7ad6f0a29da4089a848ef703c8b2bae59",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_055.wav",
      "subtitle": "——初次见面。\n我是负责照顾宁月小小姐的佣人",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_061",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10086",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "昨日お嬢ちゃまとお別れして以降、 ばあやはずっと陰ながら見守っておりました",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_061.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "8155490ed424d83f51aa7abe00a7658a5c4e7bbec97abf0206b75b82923c9437",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_061.wav",
      "subtitle": "昨天与小小姐分别之后，\n我一直在暗中跟着她",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_062",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10086",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "お別れの際に、一時避難先を記した地図をお渡ししたのですが 見かけた子猫に気を取られ、無くしてしまわれて……",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_062.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "c2bb1370f561a82aec76b62a4eb4945db779dca89126f13cdba93ada88897872",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_062.wav",
      "subtitle": "分别之时，我给了她一张标注了临时避难所的地图，\n但她被偶然看到的小猫吸引了注意力，把地图弄丢了……",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_063",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10086",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "ばあやが陰からあらゆるヒントを出すも お嬢ちゃまはまったく気づく様子もなく、困っておりました",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_063.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "69e1eb21d5a53fa482eef4e6195f9d8b503a965953ccb2c54928b6bed23c7888",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_063.wav",
      "subtitle": "我暗中给了各种提示，\n可小小姐却毫无察觉，这让我很是为难",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_065",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10086",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "お嬢ちゃまがゴミ箱の近くで眠り始め、 いよいよばあやが手を出さねばなるまいかと思っていたその時、 あなたが救ってくださったのです",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_065.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "cce258186cb1fa22ffbc14d19e9099ae7da6d32d03d26eaa937d6d1d132ad7a9",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_065.wav",
      "subtitle": "小小姐在垃圾箱旁边睡着了，\n当时我正想着是不是终于该出手了，\n就在这时，是您救了她",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_068",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10086",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "あなた方になら、安心してお嬢ちゃまを任せられます。 これから、どうぞよろしくお願いいたします",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_068.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "c7c871e18c85f0917c620496dd686e4db17d74e29fa8be79bfbcce1ebc9f2942",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_068.wav",
      "subtitle": "既然有各位在，我便能安心将小小姐托付于此了。\n今后还请多多关照",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_079",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10086",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "仰ることはごもっとも。私どもも断腸の思いなのです。 けれどこれはお嬢ちゃまにとって『越えねばならない試練』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_079.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "3bcedf558e214a7ab09c74d0c6ded1dd2477c175fa9ee30e36e45dd145cc6200",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_079.wav",
      "subtitle": "您说得很对，我们也是痛心万分，\n但这对于小小姐来说是『必须跨越的考验』",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_083",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10086",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "あなた方なら大丈夫だと、 ばあやのメイド歴７０年の直感がビンビンいっております！",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_083.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "73a9867fbc9f66b11cf918d093994038f5d8921fad98ad65d6033ef84231ace7",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_083.wav",
      "subtitle": "你们一定没问题的，\n我七十年女仆经验的直觉正强烈地告诉我！",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_084",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10086",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "それにあなた方４人の身元・経歴はすべて調査しましたし、 蕾叶様のお祖母様にはすでにご承認いただいております",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_084.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "febfe2b3f179e3f59212e1f9f2e0c6780e5d1851a6820510b6dccab0b8bb709c",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_084.wav",
      "subtitle": "况且你们四人的身份和经历，我们全都调查过了，\n也事先征得了蕾叶小姐外祖母的同意",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_090",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10086",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "まあ心強いこと。では、せめてものお礼として 本日の朝食は、このばあやにお任せくださいまし",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_090.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "ef462eb9d48363590f033a61a5504c88bdd7de1579b3932225f0c79423b778d1",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_090.wav",
      "subtitle": "真是太可靠了。那么，作为一点小小的谢礼，\n今天的早餐请务必交给我来准备",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_077",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10086",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "……会ったばかりのお嬢ちゃまのこと、 そこまで考えてくださったんですね",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_077.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "9fa1de4738d058a32550cb7eaad306266d74474bd49b773fc817ca699d75defb",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_077.wav",
      "subtitle": "……您才刚遇见我们家小小姐，\n就为她考虑得这么周全啊",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_088",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10086",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "荷物はこちらに手配済みですので お受け取りだけお願いします",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_088.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "326455458e3b9c0f2969da6117f51672127cb645d85fa1fe53baff104954a4ec",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_088.wav",
      "subtitle": "行李已经送到这里了，\n请你们查收一下",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_081",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10086",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "お嬢ちゃまは、『家族』から離れる必要があるのです。 今すぐに",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_081.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "a7b02517e6d4d9dced6c8d8a01746757a2858dfe7a2075589f12b27c7982d93d",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_081.wav",
      "subtitle": "小小姐需要远离『家人』。\n刻不容缓",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_03_123",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_03",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "もしもし。 ……はい、ご相談したいことがございまして",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_8_03/adv_voice_eventstory_8_03_123.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_03/adv_script_eventstory_8_03-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_03-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "0e184bb6fa99cdd239276cc9f30518ba97340f900c59fcad6ad1ffdb42886023",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_03_123.wav",
      "subtitle": "もしもし。 ……はい、ご相談したいことがございまして",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_05_137",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_05",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "お嬢ちゃま……よい経験ができたでしょうか",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_8_05/adv_voice_eventstory_8_05_137.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_05/adv_script_eventstory_8_05-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_05-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "dd39bb8ab2da14f6be3d36525674e13da6a1148404c5956802514db4c5a3b024",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_05_137.wav",
      "subtitle": "お嬢ちゃま……よい経験ができたでしょうか",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_059",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10086",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "いえ、ばあやはお礼に参った次第です",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_059.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_07-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "a39566cccfcff0da94471fa789da646a76fe25c25a911e1e610152181fb3c0de",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_07_059.wav",
      "subtitle": "不，我是来道谢的",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_03_122",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_03",
      "speaker": "nanny",
      "text": "……この辺りの回転寿司は１軒のみ……",
